# data/qn/raw/ holds pre-normalization processed matrices used as analysis inputs.
# Keep the directory README (it documents the required files); ignore the bulk
# matrix files themselves. Note that "raw" here means pre-normalization processed
# matrices, not raw sequencing reads.
data/qn/raw/*
!data/qn/raw/README.md
